sentences.text:
In the event of arrest of the Applicants in connection with C. R. No. 169 of 2023 dated 30th March 2023, registered with Satana Police Station, District Nashik(Rural)
for alleged offences punishable under Sections 34 and 420 of the Indian Penal Code,
they be enlarged on bail on furnishing P.R. bond in the sum of Rs. 25,000/- each with one or more sureties in the like amount.

